{"vid":"kHvLa_mEbFY","source":"kHvLa_mEbFY.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.5,"txt":"People oftentimes think that where they are is kind of a"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"little bit of a limitation or a box."},{"t":5.8,"txt":"Combo over salad with the sauce on the side."},{"t":8.3,"txt":"But oftentimes if you go above and beyond and find"},{"t":10.9,"txt":"ways to do things that will help you,"},{"t":13.2,"txt":"it'll oftentimes also help the company."},{"t":15.4,"txt":"The sort of nature of experimentation gives people"},{"t":17.7,"txt":"the freedom to grow their career in the direction they"},{"t":19.9,"txt":"want. My name is Nabeel Khan,"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"I'm 27 years old, and I went from making"},{"t":24.2,"txt":"$50,000 a year to over $430,000 in just five years"},{"t":28.2,"txt":"while I was at Amazon."},{"t":35.4,"txt":"I started at Amazon as an operations manager,"},{"t":38.2,"txt":"managing a warehouse floor."},{"t":40,"txt":"From there, I moved over to a project management role"},{"t":42.8,"txt":"and then formally transitioned to the Senior"},{"t":45.2,"txt":"Product Management title."},{"t":46.6,"txt":"Over the course of the next 1 to 2 years,"},{"t":48.8,"txt":"ended up being responsible for the roadmap for all of"},{"t":52,"txt":"the tools used to build almost all of Amazon's"},{"t":54.6,"txt":"warehouses around the world."},{"t":62.4,"txt":"I realized I wanted to be an entrepreneur pretty early in"},{"t":64.7,"txt":"my life. I always saw the life of an entrepreneur as"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"being relatively high reward,"},{"t":69.5,"txt":"but also having a high degree of variability,"},{"t":71.8,"txt":"and it's almost like a constant fun adventure."},{"t":84,"txt":"I left the University of Michigan on May 2nd,"},{"t":86.6,"txt":"and I started working at Amazon on May 11th,"},{"t":88.8,"txt":"so there was very little downtime in between when I"},{"t":91.1,"txt":"left and when I started."},{"t":98.8,"txt":"I had a group of roughly 100 warehouse associates."},{"t":101.8,"txt":"I was responsible for overseeing their daily"},{"t":104,"txt":"performance. It was a really interesting time kind of"},{"t":106.1,"txt":"post-pandemic, because everybody was really focused"},{"t":108.5,"txt":"on social distancing and working from home,"},{"t":110.6,"txt":"and that just didn't exist for me."},{"t":112,"txt":"I started every single day with 100 people coming"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"directly up to my face and asking me where they should"},{"t":117.9,"txt":"be working. My next step that I was looking towards"},{"t":124.4,"txt":"was the project management space,"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"and I eventually always had my eyes on moving to the"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"product or software space."},{"t":131.8,"txt":"I wanted to move into this space because of the fact"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"that that industry changed more and there was more"},{"t":135.6,"txt":"exciting projects, but also because of the fact"},{"t":137.7,"txt":"that those jobs paid more too."},{"t":145.8,"txt":"So what I did is looked around the warehouse that I"},{"t":148,"txt":"was in and found opportunities for me to"},{"t":150,"txt":"create new projects that I could use to build a"},{"t":152.7,"txt":"portfolio to get me to the project management role."},{"t":155.4,"txt":"I ended up getting funding from the site's general"},{"t":158,"txt":"manager, from our safety teams,"},{"t":160,"txt":"as well as creating a project opportunity that"},{"t":161.8,"txt":"involved the entire building."},{"t":163.3,"txt":"This, as well as a few other opportunities that I"},{"t":165.4,"txt":"identified, were what really helped me move to that"},{"t":167.4,"txt":"project manager opportunity."},{"t":175,"txt":"The career of product management is all about"},{"t":177.3,"txt":"looking a few years in the future,"},{"t":179.2,"txt":"devising a plan, and working backwards from"},{"t":181.5,"txt":"there. I did the same thing with my career."},{"t":183.4,"txt":"And so when I thought about the mentors I wanted to"},{"t":185.6,"txt":"have, what I did is looked at people who were a few"},{"t":188,"txt":"steps ahead of me, and then maybe 5 to 10 steps"},{"t":190.6,"txt":"ahead and ask them for advice on the skills they"},{"t":193.3,"txt":"had built and the areas in which their careers had"},{"t":195.6,"txt":"grown. I learned how to code by using a software bootcamp"},{"t":203.4,"txt":"from Georgia Tech, which I did over the course"},{"t":205.3,"txt":"of about six months."},{"t":206.6,"txt":"I was always finding ways to be creative about the role"},{"t":209.4,"txt":"that I was currently in, going above and beyond to"},{"t":212.2,"txt":"find ways that I could apply that next role,"},{"t":214.4,"txt":"and both building my career progress,"},{"t":216.4,"txt":"as well as the skills for where I wanted to go."},{"t":237.7,"txt":"I'm very fortunate that my girlfriend's law school"},{"t":240.2,"txt":"stipend covers about half of the expenses for the"},{"t":243.1,"txt":"apartment. We largely split rent,"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"as well as some of the utilities and water that"},{"t":247.9,"txt":"come with it. So there's a couple hundred other dollars"},{"t":250.1,"txt":"that are covered by that stipend too."},{"t":253.3,"txt":"Anywhere on average per month, I'm spending about"},{"t":255.4,"txt":"$5,000, which matches the income that I have"},{"t":258.1,"txt":"currently. Most of that expense is going towards"},{"t":260.7,"txt":"food, insurance and rent money."},{"t":263.7,"txt":"Transportation, thankfully, in New York is a much"},{"t":265.9,"txt":"smaller amount. I don't have to pay for a car or parking."},{"t":268.5,"txt":"I will use the subway for most of the time that I get"},{"t":270.7,"txt":"around. One of the things that I do like is just going"},{"t":273.1,"txt":"out to restaurants with my friends and girlfriend,"},{"t":275.5,"txt":"and that's probably one of the few luxuries that I"},{"t":277.6,"txt":"really keep for myself too."},{"t":284.3,"txt":"When I was at Amazon, I was a little lucky to"},{"t":286.1,"txt":"actually have a lower cost of living that enabled me to"},{"t":289.4,"txt":"save more of my money."},{"t":290.9,"txt":"I was doing a lot of travel between New York and Atlanta"},{"t":293.6,"txt":"at the time, staying both with my girlfriend for a few"},{"t":296.5,"txt":"weeks, doing a lot of work related travel,"},{"t":298.8,"txt":"and staying with some family."},{"t":300.3,"txt":"I was able to save a lot of money on rent,"},{"t":303,"txt":"since I didn't have to pay a continuous place to live."},{"t":306.1,"txt":"I was saving upwards of about 80% of what I was"},{"t":309.3,"txt":"making on a month to month basis."},{"t":315.9,"txt":"My financial goal is to have an overall net worth of $1"},{"t":319.1,"txt":"million by the time I'm 30."},{"t":320.8,"txt":"This feels like a relatively high milestone because of"},{"t":323.1,"txt":"the fact that I've been working in high net worth"},{"t":325.1,"txt":"jobs for a while, as well as the fact that I"},{"t":327.4,"txt":"want to be able to enter this next stage of my life"},{"t":329.9,"txt":"with a high degree of certainty and financial"},{"t":332.3,"txt":"stability. I knew that"},{"t":341.2,"txt":"my time at Amazon was going to be eventually limited."},{"t":344.4,"txt":"I actually had originally planned to leave earlier,"},{"t":346.9,"txt":"but it just didn't feel right yet."},{"t":353.9,"txt":"I always had the dream of owning my own company at the"},{"t":356.4,"txt":"forefront of technology when I grew up,"},{"t":358.3,"txt":"and technology was an area where I always felt I could"},{"t":360.8,"txt":"innovate and also do something new every single"},{"t":363.4,"txt":"day."},{"t":363.6,"txt":"I used to work for Amazon for a while,"},{"t":365.3,"txt":"so like pretty familiar with like at least AWS based"},{"t":368.6,"txt":"stack."},{"t":369.3,"txt":"I was reaching my late 20s, and so it felt like a great"},{"t":372.1,"txt":"time to continue taking risks in my career."},{"t":374.6,"txt":"Thankfully, because of my career at Amazon, I was able"},{"t":376.7,"txt":"to amass about $650,000 over the course of my five years"},{"t":380.6,"txt":"there, which gave me a really good financial"},{"t":382.4,"txt":"cushion to leave my job with."},{"t":392.3,"txt":"Initially I was using my own savings to cover the cost of"},{"t":395.4,"txt":"doing my business, but about 2 to 3 months in,"},{"t":398,"txt":"I was able to start paying myself back."},{"t":400.4,"txt":"And now at this point, because I'm making about"},{"t":403,"txt":"what my living expenses are,"},{"t":404.3,"txt":"I'm no longer having to rely on my own savings to"},{"t":407,"txt":"continue funding the company."},{"t":415.1,"txt":"For the near term, especially the next 1 to 2"},{"t":417.4,"txt":"years, I will probably be focusing largely just on"},{"t":420.1,"txt":"making sure the company continues to run and grow."},{"t":422.5,"txt":"Usually I spend about on average 80 hours a week"},{"t":425.8,"txt":"working, and if I'm not working,"},{"t":427.6,"txt":"I'll be spending my time with my friends and family"},{"t":430.4,"txt":"or taking care of my health in the gym."},{"t":432,"txt":"And that's frankly, all I do."},{"t":433.3,"txt":"I think a successful life to me is one that balances work"},{"t":437.3,"txt":"as well as time with family and friends."},{"t":439.6,"txt":"If I can have a really successful business and a"},{"t":441.8,"txt":"really successful family life,"},{"t":443.4,"txt":"that's kind of all that I'm trying to optimize for."},{"t":445.9,"txt":"And wherever that journey takes me is where I'm"},{"t":447.5,"txt":"willing to go. The biggest thing I've learned during my"},{"t":450.2,"txt":"career at Amazon that's helped both me and a ton of"},{"t":452.9,"txt":"the people that I've mentored,"},{"t":454.5,"txt":"is to just be creative about what you can do in your"},{"t":456.8,"txt":"current environment."},{"t":458,"txt":"People oftentimes think that where they are is kind of a"},{"t":461.2,"txt":"little bit of a limitation or a box."},{"t":463.2,"txt":"Having the agency to just look around corners,"},{"t":465.8,"txt":"try the things out that you want to do,"},{"t":467.6,"txt":"and building those things for yourself is something"},{"t":470,"txt":"that the sort of nature of experimentation gives people"},{"t":472.7,"txt":"the freedom to grow their career in the direction they"},{"t":474.9,"txt":"want."}],"words":[{"t":0.52,"w":"People"},{"t":0.52,"w":"oftentimes"},{"t":0.52,"w":"think"},{"t":0.52,"w":"that"},{"t":0.52,"w":"where"},{"t":0.52,"w":"they"},{"t":0.52,"w":"are"},{"t":0.52,"w":"is"},{"t":0.52,"w":"kind"},{"t":0.52,"w":"of"},{"t":0.52,"w":"a"},{"t":3.84,"w":"little"},{"t":3.84,"w":"bit"},{"t":3.84,"w":"of"},{"t":3.84,"w":"a"},{"t":3.84,"w":"limitation"},{"t":3.84,"w":"or"},{"t":3.84,"w":"a"},{"t":3.84,"w":"box."},{"t":5.8,"w":"Combo"},{"t":5.8,"w":"over"},{"t":5.8,"w":"salad"},{"t":5.8,"w":"with"},{"t":5.8,"w":"the"},{"t":5.8,"w":"sauce"},{"t":5.8,"w":"on"},{"t":5.8,"w":"the"},{"t":5.8,"w":"side."},{"t":8.28,"w":"But"},{"t":8.28,"w":"oftentimes"},{"t":8.28,"w":"if"},{"t":8.28,"w":"you"},{"t":8.28,"w":"go"},{"t":8.28,"w":"above"},{"t":8.28,"w":"and"},{"t":8.28,"w":"beyond"},{"t":8.28,"w":"and"},{"t":8.28,"w":"find"},{"t":10.92,"w":"ways"},{"t":10.92,"w":"to"},{"t":10.92,"w":"do"},{"t":10.92,"w":"things"},{"t":10.92,"w":"that"},{"t":10.92,"w":"will"},{"t":10.92,"w":"help"},{"t":10.92,"w":"you,"},{"t":13.24,"w":"it'll"},{"t":13.24,"w":"oftentimes"},{"t":13.24,"w":"also"},{"t":13.24,"w":"help"},{"t":13.24,"w":"the"},{"t":13.24,"w":"company."},{"t":15.36,"w":"The"},{"t":15.36,"w":"sort"},{"t":15.36,"w":"of"},{"t":15.36,"w":"nature"},{"t":15.36,"w":"of"},{"t":15.36,"w":"experimentation"},{"t":15.36,"w":"gives"},{"t":15.36,"w":"people"},{"t":17.68,"w":"the"},{"t":17.68,"w":"freedom"},{"t":17.68,"w":"to"},{"t":17.68,"w":"grow"},{"t":17.68,"w":"their"},{"t":17.68,"w":"career"},{"t":17.68,"w":"in"},{"t":17.68,"w":"the"},{"t":17.68,"w":"direction"},{"t":17.68,"w":"they"},{"t":19.92,"w"